e;a. </span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:20px; line-height:1.6em; text-align:center;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Una etiqueta con un QR-CODE a trav&eacute;s de la cual y gracias a la plataforma YOUTUBE,</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:20px; line-height:1.6em; text-align:center;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">tus clientes podr&aacute;n visualizar la historia, potencial, promoci&oacute;n, valores destacados de tus vinos</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:20px; line-height:1.6em; text-align:center;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">con el v&iacute;deo que deseen visualizar para captar su atenci&oacute;n y aumentar tus ventas.</span></span></span></span></span></p>","skin":"WRichTextThemeSkin","isQaMode":false,"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"},"comp-ld0md7k2":{"alt":"ETIQUETES AMB QR-CODE.png","width":1969,"height":771,"uri":"32797a_8c0be1d342f24855a58ddb5ed04732d6~mv2.png","name":"ETIQUETES AMB QR-CODE.png","containerId":"comp-ld0md7k2","hasBgScrollEffect":"","bgEffectName":"","displayMode":"fill","link":{},"encoding":"AVIF","allowWebpAvifTransforms":true,"responsiveImageProps":{"fallbackSrc":"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/32797a_8c0be1d342f24855a58ddb5ed04732d6~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_788,h_308,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/ETIQUETES%20AMB%20QR-CODE.png","srcset":"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/32797a_8c0be1d342f24855a58ddb5ed04732d6~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_788,h_308,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/ETIQUETES%20AMB%20QR-CODE.png 1x, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/32797a_8c0be1d342f24855a58ddb5ed04732d6~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_1576,h_616,al_c,q_90,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/ETIQUETES%20AMB%20QR-CODE.png 2x","css":{"container":{"position":"relative"},"img":{"width":788,"height":308,"objectFit":"cover"}}},"containerWidth":788,"containerHeight":308,"isInFirstFold":false,"crop":null,"onClickBehavior":"goToLink","fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WPhoto","language":"es","compId":"comp-ld0md7k2","mainPageId":"axdf2","trackClicksAnalytics":false,"popupA11yExperimentEnabled":false,"translations":{"expandAriaLabel":"Expandir imagen","zoomInButtonAriaLabel":"Zoom in"},"zoomedImageResponsiveOverride":{},"allowFullGIFTransformation":false},"comp-ld0mmtmc":{"withShadow":true,"link":{},"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.VectorImage","language":"es","mainPageId":"axdf2","compId":"comp-ld0mmtmc","trackClicksAnalytics":false,"experiments":{"specs.thunderbolt.DatePickerPortal":true,"specs.thunderbolt.DisableDocumentScrollWhenLightBoxOpen":true,"specs.thunderbolt.EnableCustomCSSVarsForLoginSocialBar":true,"specs.thunderbolt.FreemiumBannerOdeditor":true,"specs.thunderbolt.TextInputAutoFillFix":true,"specs.thunderbolt.UseLoginSocialBarCu